  "prompt": "Build VHS Tracking from the exact v4 200×150px photo-roses cover crop at (86,28), 14px corners, unchanged border SVG, 200×12px blurred band at y=92 and 200×2px tracking line at y=98. Retain each original SVG payload and intrinsic dimensions. Active native tracking paints the complete original four-band, two-pixel-row wrapped chroma and eighteen seeded head-switch marks; full retains its complete 368×268 field and photo-sea. Preserve the original focus/intensity map, 1180ms sine-power envelope, automatic cadence, interruption and recovery. Expose Lose tracking and Restore tape; hover, touch and arrows operate the original tracking head. Credit Pawel Czerwinski and Pawel Czerwinski. Keep a 240×168 hero plane and a separate complete 400×400 full view with native scrolling and readable Geist/Geist Mono. Prefix classes with rootClass; place actions in the shell. Preserve every original source state, dataset, duration, seeded random sequence, automatic cadence and interruption. Normalize pointer and touch coordinates through the actual fitted field; retain arrow keys, Home, Space/Enter and Escape, independent caller/viewport pauses, ordered queued intent and complete cleanup. Reduced motion uses a deliberate still and interruptible 150ms opacity feedback. Embed local approved photos, fonts and licence comments in network-independent exports.",
